sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as GDBWidget / CmdWidget
    participant Core as core.Debugger
    participant Client as gdb.GDBClient
    participant PTY as GDB PTY
    participant GDB as GDB MI2

    UI->>Core: Send("break main")
    Core->>Client: Write PTY
    Client->>GDB: MI command
    GDB-->>PTY: ~console / ^done / *stopped
    PTY-->>Client: Read chunk
    Client-->>UI: GdbOutputMsg via channel
    UI->>UI: GdbInputState burst + MiMsg parse
    UI->>UI: Buffer.AppendBuffer → redraw
